## Title: Array Element Frequency Counter

### Main Goal
This obfuscated JavaScript code defines a function called `frequencyLists` that takes a (potentially nested) array as input, flattens it into a single-level array, and then counts the frequency of each unique element, returning an object that maps each element to its occurrence count.

### How It Works (Deobfuscated Logic)
